": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974751_504344525677880_8757980474147716254_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tZF-d5DInvgQ7kNvwGSZjKK&_nc_oc=AdoPL8v6POeje7F4fRMupPMr3iec8GiimJmrXZDjkiibiFZn05ZmpByZc_DRW6OFZXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH_GbV7KbgHM7C2kGFXmanvlrSdTSxfw8F2YgZ7MCYDeA&oe=6A859C2B"}]}, "id": "1238928606731869", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "image1.png", "id": "1057387732496751", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540501_1057387735830084_2190979014283040881_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q-zxNJRqvVoQ7kNvwHu2X2M&_nc_oc=AdrvGnMRJfSJI5o_QDU86UaAcoNpTceqW5CUzv3y52OPJkldRb_2AZtkDavxB0qxL3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE1NWXwYsua79fBczrs0QUuYfiOmE9MI3Rnie7Yzbmpeg&oe=6A85AAF3"}, {"file_name": "image2.png", "id": "410575135384874", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974821_410575138718207_8230945586108737660_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AlZlm8fuFtgQ7kNvwHp8fYb&_nc_oc=AdqNvQJbcoZf0rqm7bm3z63QImkdPw4Tw782grJRa3XiK0M258fPP9gdyxOP1_eZstg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFEkGPAlz1nbMKfv4KdBoWVaUcyZ2RgPDOwwFqv04CSJw&oe=6A859FD8"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "27882995044633476", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_27882995047966809_2560160188894003364_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aubhKeBMBXUQ7kNvwEfm_78&_nc_oc=AdqOlHvOP7hkEaYFtAWhfFO5g1umKjyDOOXAaVrZQiax0l5UXmsVI2wkj18eF_URbR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH2D1MZ0Rp2K5RXiZEewp9ly8yFg-Ev34pdKsw-Wpi4Eg&oe=6A8581F9"}, {"file_name": "image3.png", "id": "1012617210657646", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75280177_1012617213990979_1732549949916101256_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MYTKqZLzsAgQ7kNvwFLFpQ8&_nc_oc=Adq3aqoEowFo9ux6pwcDPwKmK_rurYxrKNG4QehkDJ19P-XSOWyjwop3QTWPwPzzRVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH3MHojKRYymv0h8VSFk58cEnSRWs35wJUMncYo5LVqwA&oe=6A8583B8"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1151089155995496", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974848_1151089159328829_2039739925044486928_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hYPY0wIHqdoQ7kNvwEn1iWh&_nc_oc=AdopBlbpu3VmYJRZxUm3GvcfBj4TnN66FmfjTS_OxkbLQdEDAAxYZDX25EA8SIe9_6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGDyLHDjsbPR1XvgJ7eOHhH-o5WIAgGaVf4Pdl1U-oTEw&oe=6A857CAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Keyart_2560x1440.png", "id": "1984373528679847", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974591_1984373532013180_122028893976097645_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kxY5FGnc_QgQ7kNvwFpJY18&_nc_oc=Adpcymgt2AbaFhew7fxtB_HtweZ94pSU42ezjv27-od0E7__Gm04n5NZH0QWx28FePw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHJ2VFtE7pqrOeQRmgim8GXw2WxjAxZWDoBgnhiqo4ySA&oe=6A858FBB"}, "display_name": "My Monsters - Demo", "keywords": ["Third", "Action", "Adventure", "Indie", "Fanstasy"], "long_description": "My Monsters is an action-adventure VR game that with a *100% hand-painted art*, creating a visually stunning *world full of fantasy and surrealism*. At the heart of the game is a deep narrative that explores humanity's greatest inner struggles\u2014anxiety, fear, and loneliness. As a player, you are transported to Onirium, a *dream-like realm* where you meet Moti, a frightened little monster with no memory.\n\nIn My Monsters, you\u2019re never alone. *Team up with your inner monster*, Moti, to face a variety of enemies, solve intricate puzzles, and overcome challenges in a shared journey. This partnership mechanic fosters a powerful connection with Moti, requiring empathy and courage to navigate obstacles and reveal fragments of a *meaningful dreamlike tale*. Every stage introduces new aspects of this bond, allowing players to experience moments of self-discovery and emotional depth.\n\nKey Features on Demo:\n\n\n\u2694\ufe0f  Combat Enemies: Engage in dynamic battles with your enemies.\n\n\ud83e\udde9  Solve Puzzles: Test your critical thinking and problem-solving skills.\n\n\ud83c\udf19  A Dream-like Tale: Uncover a touching, emotional narrative that delves into themes of self-reflection and growth. \n\n\ud83c\udfa8  100% Hand-Painted Art: Every visual element in the game is carefully crafted by hand, creating a beautiful, one-of-a-kind experience. \n\n\ud83e\udd1d  Team Up with Your Inner Monster: Build a meaningful relationship with Moti, using teamwork, empathy, and courage to overcome every challenge.\n\n*THE GAME IS CURRENTLY IN DEVELOPMENT, AND ITS CONTENT MAY CHANGE.*", "short_description": "My Monsters is a VR action-adventure game featuring stunning 100% hand-painted art. In this demo, you\u2019ll explore Onirium, a dream-like world filled with emotional depth, as you face humanity's greatest inner monsters like anxiety and fear. Meet Moti, a scared little monster with no memory, and team up to battle enemies, solve puzzles, and overcome challenges. Unravel fragments of a dreamlike narrative as you journey together. The game is currently in development, and its content may change."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mymonsters.ludact.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ludact", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mymonsters.ludact.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null